<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alfa upped. [CORRECTED 16:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alfa upped. [CORRECTED 16:55 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said on Tuesday analyst Kerry McHugh had raised her rating for Mexico's Alfa SA to the recommend list from market outperform. (Corrects rate move from &quot;downgrade&quot;).</p>
<p>-- Shares in the industrial conglomerate fell 30 centavos to 44.60 pesos in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, 212 859-1879))</p>
